---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="HR na Mishahara — Usimamizi wa Wafanyakazi, Likizo, Usindikaji wa Mishahara"
  description="Rekodi za wafanyakazi, usimamizi wa likizo, ufuatiliaji wa mahudhurio, usindikaji wa mishahara na uzingatiaji wa NSSF na kodi, tathmini na kuajiri. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/ajira-mishahara/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">HR na Mishahara</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>HR na Mishahara</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Kutoka kuajiri hadi kustaafu. Rekodi za wafanyakazi, likizo, mahudhurio, mishahara, tathmini na uzingatiaji wa sheria — katika mfumo mmoja.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Wasimamizi wa HR, maafisa wa mishahara, wakuu wa idara na viongozi wanaohitaji kusimamia shughuli za wafanyakazi kwa usafi — mikataba, likizo, mahudhurio, mishahara na uzingatiaji wa sheria — bila kuhifadhi karatasi za hesabu za ziada.</p>
    <p>Kama shirika lako lina wafanyakazi — iwe ni kumi au elfu — moduli hii ndiyo inayosimamia kila kitu kutoka siku ya kwanza hadi ya mwisho.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Rekodi za Wafanyakazi</h3><p>Faili kamili la mfanyakazi: maelezo binafsi, masharti ya mkataba, idara, cheo, mstari wa kuripoti, maelezo ya benki na mawasiliano ya dharura.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Likizo</h3><p>Aina za likizo (kila mwaka, ugonjwa, uzazi, masomo, bila mshahara). Wafanyakazi wanaomba. Wasimamizi wanaidhinisha. Salio linasasishwa kwa otomatiki.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ufuatiliaji wa Mahudhurio</h3><p>Ingiza data ya mahudhurio kutoka mifumo ya kibiolojia. Fuatilia mahudhurio ya kila siku, kazi za ziada na kutokuwepo. Ripoti za mahudhurio kwa ajili ya mishahara.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usindikaji wa Mishahara</h3><p>Sanidi mapato (msingi, marupurupu, kazi za ziada) na makato (NSSF, kodi ya mapato, mikopo). Endesha mishahara ya kila mwezi kutoka kwa mshahara wa kabla hadi wa baada ya kodi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Uzingatiaji wa Sheria</h3><p>Hesabu za NSSF na kodi ya mapato zimejumuishwa. Inaweza kubadilishwa kwa mamlaka za kodi za Afrika Mashariki na Kati. Tengeneza ratiba za NSSF na kurudi za kodi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Tathmini za Utendaji</h3><p>Mifano ya tathmini na viashiria na ujuzi. Wafanyakazi wanajitathmini. Wasimamizi wanatoa alama na maoni. Fuatilia mizunguko ya tathmini kwa idara.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Chati ya Shirika</h3><p>Onyesha muundo wa shirika. Idara, mistari ya kuripoti na idadi. Chati inaonyesha maelezo ya mtu binafsi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Kuajiri</h3><p>Chapisha nafasi, pokea maombi, fuatilia wagombea kupitia hatua za uteuzi na usaili. Geuza wagombea waliofanikiwa kuwa wafanyakazi.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Jinsi moduli zinavyoungana</h2>
    <p>Moduli ya HR na mishahara inaunganishwa na fedha na uendeshaji:</p>
    <ul class="connection-list">
      <li><strong>Uhasibu</strong> → uhasibu wa mshahara, NSSF, PAYE na net kulipwa unapoidhinishwa mishahara</li>
      <li><strong>Miradi</strong> → gharama za wafanyakazi zinaweza kugawiwa kwa miradi kupitia karatasi za saa</li>
      <li><strong>Manunuzi</strong> → mikopo ya wafanyakazi inaweza kutolewa kupitia mfumo wa malipo</li>
      <li><strong>Ripoti</strong> → data ya wafanyakazi na gharama za mishahara zinaonyeshwa kwenye dashibodi</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Udhibiti na ruhusa</h2>
    <div class="controls-grid">
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Uidhinishaji wa Likizo</h3><p>Maombi ya likizo yanahitaji uidhinishaji kutoka kwa msimamizi. Salio linasasishwa kwa otomatiki baada ya uidhinishaji.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Usiri wa Mishahara</h3><p>Data ya mishahara inalindwa. Mtumiaji anaona mshahara wake tu. Wasimamizi waona timu yao tu. HR inaona wote.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Njia ya Ukaguzi</h3><p>Kila mabadiliko ya rekodi za wafanyakazi yanarekodiwa: nani, lini, na nini kilibadilishwa. INSERT-tu.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Ruhusa za Kuajiri</h3><p>Ruhusa tofauti za kutangaza nafasi, kupokea maombi, kufanya usaili na kutoa ofa. Mzunguko wa uidhinishaji.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>Ona kwa macho</h2>
    <p class="screenshot-intro">Picha kutoka mfumo halisi wa Kraal Code — inakuja hivi karibuni.</p>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Rekodi za Wafanyakazi</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Usimamizi wa Likizo</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Usindikaji wa Mishahara</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Chati ya Shirika</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona HR na mishahara kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa mahitaji ya uendeshaji wa wafanyakazi.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.container--narrow p{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);line-height:var(--kc-leading-relaxed);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-4)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list{margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.connection-list li{margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-3);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list strong{color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.controls-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.control-item{padding:var(--kc-space-5);border-left:3px solid var(--kc-teal)}.control-item h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-1)}.control-item p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.screenshot-intro{color:var(--kc-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-slot{aspect-ratio:16/10}.screenshot-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:2px dashed var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);gap:var(--kc-space-2)}.screenshot-label{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.screenshot-note{font-size:var(--kc-text-xs);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid,.controls-grid,.screenshot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
